 ### Surface-aware density formulation
-A method to extract high-quality surfaces from NeRF by modeling geometry as a distance function or occupancy field and converting its output to density using a probability density function [S23]. Incorporate an eikonal term to encourage geometric consistency, enforcing that the gradient norm of the learned SDF is equal to one [S23]. Density distribution: $\Phi_S(x) = \frac{se^{-sx}}{1+e^{-sx}}$, where s is a scaling parameter and x is the SDF or occupancy value [S23].
